  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Section 23-31-250(B)): Any federal law, treaty, executive order, rule, or regulation related to limiting or proscribing the carry of weapons and weapon accessories must be evaluated by the Attorney General.\nSection 1 (Section 23-31-250(B)): The Attorney General shall issue a written opinion of whether the law, treaty, executive order, rule, or regulation purports to compel legislative or executive action prohibited pursuant to subsection (A)."
